00:11:26.986 --> 00:11:30.156
-Adjective.

00:11:30.156 --> 00:11:32.357
-Striped.

00:11:32.357 --> 00:11:35.360
-A type of profession.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.695
-A cruise director.

00:11:36.695 --> 00:11:39.698
[ Laughter ]

00:11:39.698 --> 00:11:41.667
-Cruise director.
Oh, these are great.

00:11:41.667 --> 00:11:43.735
Type of relative.

00:11:43.735 --> 00:11:46.438
-Second cousin.

00:11:46.538 --> 00:11:47.739
-Second cousin.

00:11:47.739 --> 00:11:49.775
Male name.

00:11:49.775 --> 00:11:51.143
-Gary.

00:11:52.678 --> 00:11:55.114
-Made-up song title.

00:11:55.114 --> 00:11:57.449
-"Feel My Face."

00:11:57.449 --> 00:12:01.620
[ Laughter ]

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.222
-"Feel My Face." All right.

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:04.556
We filled out the words
for our scene.

00:12:04.556 --> 00:12:06.024
You ready to perform?
-Yes.

00:12:06.024 --> 00:12:08.293
-Here we go.
Let's go.

00:12:08.293 --> 00:12:10.329
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:12:15.033 --> 00:12:17.335
-Well, if it isn't
my favorite patient,

00:12:17.335 --> 00:12:19.972
Mr. Gooby Gock.

00:12:19.972 --> 00:12:23.375
-Thanks for seeing me on such
short notice, Dr. Mackerel.

00:12:23.375 --> 00:12:26.344
So, what's the news?

00:12:26.344 --> 00:12:28.180
-Well, we just finished
processing your test,

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.649
and unfortunately,
the results are swirling.

00:12:32.417 --> 00:12:34.220
-Get out, you!

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:36.488
[ Laughter ]

00:12:36.488 --> 00:12:38.356
-I completely understand
that reaction.

00:12:38.356 --> 00:12:42.794
Your blood pressure
is 59 over 2.

00:12:42.794 --> 00:12:47.900
And our X-rays found a canoe
in your Achilles' heel.

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:50.002
[ Laughter ]

00:12:50.002 --> 00:12:52.771
It also appears that you have
a rare condition

00:12:52.771 --> 00:12:55.007
known as
Fluffy Platypus Disease.

00:12:55.007 --> 00:12:57.209
[ Laughter ]

00:12:57.209 --> 00:12:59.879
-Toot!

00:12:59.879 --> 00:13:02.014
Is there any way to cure it?

00:13:02.014 --> 00:13:05.184
-I'm going to write you
a prescription for these pills

00:13:05.184 --> 00:13:07.219
right here
that I have in my pocket.

00:13:07.219 --> 00:13:10.922
I want you to take one
every two hours.

00:13:10.922 --> 00:13:14.093
-But I heard those pills cause
involuntary drinking.

00:13:16.962 --> 00:13:18.697
-I'm afraid they do.

00:13:18.697 --> 00:13:21.733
Side effects also include
an itchy armpit

00:13:21.733 --> 00:13:24.236
and a decrease
in the desire to hammer.

00:13:24.236 --> 00:13:26.272
[ Laughter ]

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.476
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:13:32.343 --> 00:13:34.045
-That a medical term?

00:13:34.045 --> 00:13:35.447
Uh, wh--

00:13:35.447 --> 00:13:37.082
[ Laughter ]

00:13:37.082 --> 00:13:39.318
What can I do to stay healthy?

00:13:40.652 --> 00:13:42.888
-I would suggest
waking up early...

00:13:42.888 --> 00:13:44.189
-[ Laughs ]

00:13:44.189 --> 00:13:47.059
-...every morning
and doing stretches

00:13:47.059 --> 00:13:48.394
and then biting in the park.

00:13:48.394 --> 00:13:50.695
[ Laughter ]

00:13:50.695 --> 00:13:52.363
-That's great advice,

00:13:52.363 --> 00:13:55.634
especially for a striped
cruise director such as myself.

00:13:57.702 --> 00:13:59.371
-You know, the best part
about being a doctor

00:13:59.371 --> 00:14:01.673
is that I get to treat
patients like you

00:14:01.673 --> 00:14:03.842
and then go home
to my second cousin, Gary...

00:14:03.842 --> 00:14:05.878
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:14.686
...and then sing them
my favorite song.

00:14:14.686 --> 00:14:16.154
-Which is?

00:14:16.154 --> 00:14:19.458
-"Feel My Face."
[ Groans ]

00:14:19.458 --> 00:14:21.894
-How does it go?
Can you sing it for me?

00:14:21.894 --> 00:14:24.730
[ Laughter ]

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:28.033
"Feel My Face."
-Yes.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.771
♪ You and me gotta get
out of this place ♪

00:14:32.771 --> 00:14:36.642
♪ And come back to apartment
so you can feel my face ♪

00:14:36.642 --> 00:14:39.979
♪ Touch my body, touch my body ♪

00:14:39.979 --> 00:14:41.480
-Thank you very much, Doctor.
I appreciate it.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.182
-I'm so sorry.
-Uh, no, please.

00:14:44.182 --> 00:14:46.051
And scene!

00:14:46.051 --> 00:14:47.753
That is how you do it
right there.

00:14:47.753 --> 00:14:49.922
Kristen Wiig!
That's how you do it!

